0..74 Comment "// Tactics over goals: a splice `~t` stands where a value is read and runs"
75..150 Comment "// the tactic `t` at the goal the position holds, the binders in scope with"
151..228 Comment "// their types and the type the value is checked against (#2762). The checker"
229..302 Comment "// runs the tactic, judges the term it answers against the goal again and"
303..380 Comment "// fills the splice with it, so the kernel replays the filled declaration and"
381..459 Comment "// no tactic is trusted. Two tactics stand: `assumption`, the innermost binder"
460..535 Comment "// whose type is the goal\'s, and `intro(t)`, a function whose body is `t`\'s"
536..596 Comment "// answer under the binder it introduces. What refuses is in"
597..659 Comment "// `../../pathological/metaprograms/tactics-over-goals.gandr`."
661..725 Comment "/// The innermost integer in scope: `b`, which stands after `a`."
